abstract: >-
  Claim-bounded consolidation of frozen Metriplane external-source evidence:
  one source-specific ManiSkill GO, one CALVIN NO-GO, one source-specific
  robomimic GO, one partially audited MimicGen row, and untested RoboCasa and
  ROS 2 / MCAP + TF2 rows. The package is owner-generated and does not claim
  independent validation, universal compatibility, physical accuracy, safety,
  production readiness, or source-project endorsement.
